1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,180
That tiny pocket

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,836
inside your jeans pocket?

3
00:00:02,856 --> 00:00:04,353
What is it even for?

4
00:00:04,373 --> 00:00:04,593
Is it for

5
00:00:04,593 --> 00:00:06,058
one single grape?

6
00:00:06,078 --> 00:00:08,264
Let's go back to the 1800s.

7
00:00:08,284 --> 00:00:09,494
Cowboys, miners,

8
00:00:09,494 --> 00:00:10,474
and railroad workers

9
00:00:10,474 --> 00:00:12,374
wore tough denim jeans.

10
00:00:12,394 --> 00:00:13,254
And many of them

11
00:00:13,254 --> 00:00:14,808
carried pocket watches.

12
00:00:14,828 --> 00:00:16,398
But a watch in a big pocket

13
00:00:16,398 --> 00:00:16,998
gets scratched,

14
00:00:16,998 --> 00:00:18,523
smashed, or lost.

15
00:00:18,543 --> 00:00:20,363
So jeans got a tiny pocket,

16
00:00:20,363 --> 00:00:21,803
just the right size.

17
00:00:21,823 --> 00:00:23,123
That's why it's called

18
00:00:23,123 --> 00:00:23,908
the watch pocket.

19
00:00:23,928 --> 00:00:25,728
Pocket watches disappeared.

20
00:00:25,728 --> 00:00:27,018
The pocket didn't.

21
00:00:27,038 --> 00:00:28,488
Today it holds coins,

22
00:00:28,488 --> 00:00:29,538
keys, guitar picks,

23
00:00:29,538 --> 00:00:30,558
and mostly,

24
00:00:30,558 --> 00:00:31,930
absolutely nothing.

25
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,352
I'm keeping the grape.

26
00:00:33,372 --> 00:00:34,272
Follow for more

27
00:00:34,272 --> 00:00:35,360
hidden designs.
